      "text": [
        "Everything a small business needs from a website — nothing it doesn't.",
        "We keep the process straightforward: one point of contact, a site that actually gets finished, and ongoing support so it keeps working long after launch.",
        "Website design & build",
        "A custom-designed site built around what your business actually needs — booking forms, price lists, galleries, click-to-call, the lot.",
        "Hosting & maintenance",
        "Secure UK hosting, software updates, daily backups and uptime monitoring, handled for you as part of your plan.",
        "Ongoing content updates",
        "Need new photos, prices or an opening-hours change? Send us the details and we'll make the edit — no logins or tech skills required.",
        "Local SEO setup",
        "We optimise for the searches that bring in local customers, and connect your Google Business Profile to your site.",
        "Monthly performance reports",
        "A short, plain-English report each month showing visitors, enquiries and what we've done to improve your site.",
        "Online bookings & shops",
        "Add booking systems, payment links or a simple online shop, and we'll keep it running smoothly alongside the rest of your site.",
        "What we do"
