      "text": [
        "Small businesses, real results.",
        "\"Doman Digital rebuilt our old site in under three weeks. Enquiries through the contact form have more than doubled and we don't have to think about hosting or updates at all.\"",
        "\"I run a plumbing business and had zero time to deal with a website. They handled everything — design, the booking form, even chasing me for photos. Genuinely painless.\"",
        "\"The monthly report actually makes sense to me, which is rare. When I want a price changed I just email them and it's done the same day.\"",
